{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PC Building Empire</strong> is an <strong>indie idle &amp; cozy game</strong> focused on <strong>light management</strong>, currently in <strong>Early Access</strong>. The goal is to grow together with community feedback, expanding simulation and strategy over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you run a small computer shop that slowly grows:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build computers</strong> in assembly rooms, with rarities that affect results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage workers</strong>, each with unique buffs and debuffs that can speed up or slow down progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create videos</strong> in production rooms to boost your brand\u2019s visibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handle warranties</strong> in dedicated rooms, processing products efficiently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your company</strong> by buying new rooms and customizing floors, colors, and style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire staff</strong> from the central computer by posting job ads and choosing your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax</strong> with idle progression while your workers produce and manage tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble PCs manually</strong> in a minigame that teaches essential parts and their rarities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re hiring, producing, customizing, or just letting things run on their own, <strong>PC Building Empire</strong> is designed for those who enjoy <strong>light simulation, constant progression, and the cozy feeling of watching your shop thrive</strong>.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sell 10 Common PCs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3588630/acfa2e3d44077f085b4f15749603ac256e791f